7-n0026","politics-2-p007-n0027","politics-2-p007-n0028"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0011","text":"基层民主是全过程人民主的重要体现","bbox":[518.022,384.715,208.803,12.283],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0029","politics-2-p007-n0030","politics-2-p007-n0031","politics-2-p007-n0032"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0012","text":"三、巩固和发展新时代爱国统一战线","bbox":[354.255,543.621,196.521,12.283],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0033"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0013","text":"1.统一战线","bbox":[579.947,450.802,55.984,16.821],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0034","politics-2-p007-n0035"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0014","text":"是中国共产D夺取革命、建设、改革事业胜利的重要法宝","bbox":[665.157,415.489,303.082,16.822],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0036","politics-2-p007-n0037","politics-2-p007-n0038"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0015","text":"也是实现中华民族伟大复兴的重要法宝","bbox":[665.157,455.34,208.804,12.283],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0039"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0016","text":"统战工作的本质要求是大团结大联合，解决的就是人心和力量问题","bbox":[665.157,490.652,356.194,12.283],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0040","politics-2-p007-n0041","politics-2-p007-n0042"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0017","text":"2.统战工作的关键是要坚持求同存异","bbox":[579.947,539.083,193.27,16.821],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0043","politics-2-p007-n0044","politics-2-p007-n0045"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0018","text":"发扬“团结一批评一团结”的优良传统","bbox":[802.568,521.426,192.743,16.821],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0046","politics-2-p007-n0047","politics-2-p007-n0048","politics-2-p007-n0049","politics-2-p007-n0050"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0019","text":"在尊重多样性中寻求一致性，找到最大公约数、画出最大同心圆","bbox":[802.568,561.277,343.912,12.283],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0051","politics-2-p007-n0052","politics-2-p007-n0053","politics-2-p007-n0054","politics-2-p007-n0055"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0020","text":"3.D的领导是统一战线最鲜明的特征","bbox":[579.947,645.728,189.227,16.88],"nodeIds":["politics-2-p007-n0056","politics-2-p007-n0057","politics-2-p007-n0058","politics-2-p007-n0059","politics-2-p007-n0060"]},{"id":"politics-2-p007-b0021","text":"坚持D的领导是统一战线最核心最根本的问题"